{ 1. d4  ♘f6  2. c4  g6  3. ♘c3  ♗g7  4. e4  d6  5. h3  O-O  6. ♗e3  e5  7. d5           ♖♘♗♕⨯♖♔⨯         ⨯♙♙⨯⨯♙♗♙         ⨯⨯⨯♙⨯♘♙⨯         ♙⨯⨯♙♙⨯⨯⨯         ⨯⨯♙⨯♙⨯⨯⨯         ⨯⨯♘⨯♗⨯⨯♙         ♙♙⨯⨯⨯♙♙⨯         ♖⨯⨯♕♔♗♘♖     Black has several options besides 7...♘a6 or 7...a5 . The most popular of these is 7...c6 .  Our standard response to almost every move is  g2-g4 , with the exception of 7...♘h5 after which we play 8. g3 followed by 8. ♗e2 , obtaining a solid advantage.}

