{ 1. d4  ♘f6  2. c4  g6  3. ♘c3  ♗g7  4. e4  d6  5. h3           ♖♘♗♕♔⨯⨯♖         ♙♙♙⨯♙♙♗♙         ⨯⨯⨯♙⨯♘♙⨯         ⨯⨯⨯⨯⨯⨯⨯⨯         ⨯⨯♙♙♙⨯⨯⨯         ⨯⨯♘⨯⨯⨯⨯♙         ♙♙⨯⨯⨯♙♙⨯         ♖⨯♗♕♔♗♘♖     Castling is by far the most popular move in this position, yet some alternatives deserve attention. In particular,  5...♘c6!? and an original plan in which Black voluntarily gives up castling rights 5... e5  6. d5  h5  7. ♘f3  ♗h6!?   }

